	             People Euro 0,
	             Act BI*BI per capita*sum(adult population s[skill!]))/People 1
	~	Euro
	~		|

BI per capita=
	5000*ramp(0.25,11,15)
	~	Euro
	~	3000 euros/year per capita
	|

BI tax rate hike=
