	UIC delay i[ind], Year 1 , UIC delay initial i[ind])
	~	Euro/Goods
	~		|

UIC i[ind]=
	ZIDZ(((z demand nom i[ind]+(depreciation K i[ind]*price capital delay)*euro 1* Year 1\
		/ Euro constant 1)),y real i[ind])*euro 1/ Euro constant 1
	~	Euro/Goods
	~	unit intermediate costs
	|

